// An in-browser stand-in for the Tauri backend, used by `pnpm --dir app dev` in a plain
// browser. It serves the demo worksheet (`demo.opened.json`, generated by the Rust test
// `demo_fixture_matches_what_open_worksheet_returns` from `demo.eqv`, so the AST and
// the view are exactly what the real commands return) with canned results, and implements
// add / move / delete / undo / redo and a simulated calculation with progress and stop.

